msgid ""
"Server models of the hosts: chassis, CPU, RAM, GPUs, boot volumes and "
"network cards. Check reads every host of a profile (its IPMI first, then its"
" OS) and compares; a new host gets the profile that fits its hardware. The "
"port aliases make the bonds. A profile can be edited until it is verified."
msgstr ""
