"Every role always keeps at least one active user. A super admin has every "
"right whatever roles are ticked; the roles ticked decide which approvals and"
" notices come to them. Taking the super admin role from another super admin "
"needs the confirmation of the other super admins within 48 hours."
msgstr ""
"У каждой роли всегда есть хотя бы один активный пользователь. У супер-админа"
